    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Auxiliary Cadre",
    "summary": "Your **KROOT** and **VESPID STINGWINGS** units get the ability below:\n\n**Harnessed Alien Instincts**: during [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), you can have this unit pick a **[visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility)** enemy unit up to 12\" from it. That enemy unit becomes **prey-marked**, and a **prey-marked** unit gets +3\" **detection range**.\n\nYour **GHOSTKEEL BATTLESUIT** and **STEALTH BATTLESUITS** units get the ability below:\n\n**Localised Stealth Projectors (Aura)**: after a **KROOT** or **VESPID STINGWINGS** unit of yours up to 6\" from this unit has shot, its attacks do not stop it from being **[hidden](vsdata:core-rule/hidden)**.\n\nNo other **AUXILIARIES** **detachment** can be taken with this one, as it is tagged **AUXILIARIES**.",
